NAME
    gcloud beta backup-dr backup-vaults - manage Backup and DR backup vaults

SYNOPSIS
    gcloud beta backup-dr backup-vaults COMMAND [GCLOUD_WIDE_FLAG ...]

DESCRIPTION
    (BETA) Manage Backup and DR backup vaults.

GCLOUD WIDE FLAGS
    These flags are available to all commands: --help.

    Run $ gcloud help for details.

COMMANDS
    COMMAND is one of the following:

     create
        (BETA) Create a Backup and DR backup vault.

     delete
        (BETA) Delete the specified Backup Vault.

     describe
        (BETA) Show the metadata for a Backup and DR backup vault.

     list
        (BETA) List Backup and DR backup vaults.

     update
        (BETA) Update a Backup and DR backup vault.

NOTES
    This command is currently in beta and might change without notice. These
    variants are also available:

        $ gcloud backup-dr backup-vaults

        $ gcloud alpha backup-dr backup-vaults

